  "finalText": "Both issues were correct, and RMA-807 and RMA-816 are now refunded, restocked and closed. My earlier report was wrong to say nothing had arrived for them. The warehouse logged a receipt for each on 2026-07-25.\n\n**RMA-807 (order O-8007, line L1):** 1 pair of headphones (P-HDP) arrived in resellable condition.\n- The customer asked to return it on 07-20 because they changed their mind. That was 12 days after it shipped on 07-08, so it's inside the 30-day window.\n- The request date falls within PU-21 (no fee on change-of-mind returns requested 07-10 to 07-20), so I charged no restocking fee.\n- I refunded 15,900 to the card (refund RF-16), put 1 back into sellable stock (9 → 10) and closed the return.\n\n**RMA-816 (order O-8016, line L1):** 1 mouse (P-MOU) arrived in resellable condition.\n- The customer asked to return it on 07-21 because they changed their mind. That was 7 days after it shipped on 07-14, so it's inside the window.\n- The request came one day after PU-21 ended, so the standard 15% fee applies: 735 on 4,900.\n- I refunded 4,165 to the card (refund RF-17), put 1 back into sellable stock (21 → 22) and closed the return.\n\nAll amounts are in cents. I made no other changes, so every other return from the earlier pass stays as it was.",
